    </statement>
  </task>
  <task>
    <statement>
      <p>Apply each of the filters above to Figures (a)--(c) using stride <m>S=1</m>.</p>
    </statement>
  </task>
  <task>
    <statement>
      <p>Apply ReLU elementwise to the convolved matrices.</p>
    </statement>
  </task>
  <task>
    <statement>
      <p>Perform max pooling on the resulting matrices (the convolved matrices to which ReLU was applied elementwise) using a <m>2\times2</m> block with stride <m>S=1</m>.</p>
    </statement>
  </task>
  <task>
    <statement>
      <p>Examine the resulting matrices, and discuss what each of these filters is doing.</p>
    </statement>
  </task>
  <task>
